description: Wrap complex financial mutations in db.transaction.
globs: src/actions/**/*.ts
---

# Drizzle ACID Transactions Standard

- Transaction Boundary: Wrap all multi-step state mutations (billing, stock adjustments, contra settlements, vouchers) inside `db.transaction(async (tx) => { ... })`.
- Atomic Commit & Rollback: Throwing errors must cleanly trigger rollback and return typed error responses.
- Atomic Sequences: Never read max invoice numbers with raw SELECTs. Always read native PostgreSQL sequences atomically via `SELECT nextval('kacha_invoice_seq')` or `SELECT nextval('pakka_invoice_seq')`.
- Double-Entry Balance: Verify debit == credit before transaction commit.
